# Google Gemini API key — required for generating study materials.
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# Setup:
#   1. Copy this file to ".env.local"  (cp .env.local.example .env.local)
#   2. Paste your key below, with no quotes and no spaces.
#
# The free tier allowed 20 requests/day on gemini-2.5-flash in October 2026.
# Check your own limit at https://ai.dev/rate-limit
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model (defaults to gemini-2.5-flash).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# Optional: a Supabase database, so generated material survives restarts and can
# be reused for identical documents. Without these, the cache lives in memory.
# Run supabase/schema.sql once in your project's SQL Editor first.
#   URL: the dashboard's Connect dialog
#   Secret key: Settings > API Keys (starts with sb_secret_). Server only: never
#   give it a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
